          "source_value": "Algorithms are deterministic and adaptive. Queries, stopping, and postprocessing may be arbitrary measurable functions of the transcript. The output may be unqueried, a deterministic selection of a past point, or an admissible average. No linear-span or zero-respecting restriction is imposed. Queries are sequential; each actual response in a parallel batch is charged separately. Arithmetic, linear algebra, and storage using received data are uncharged. Internal operations, memory, and communication are not tracked by this quantity.",
